# Conformance probe pack for spec 0.94: common lines and two kinds that hold only `requires` (ruling 6). Public.
format     conformance-held-by
version    0.94.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       json
field   probe.x  a   int
field   probe.y  b   int
field   uid      id  string
kind    by-a
requires probe.x
kind    by-b
requires probe.y
